Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.62,0:00:16.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa tidak membunuhku?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.08,0:00:22.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tanya balik, kenapa kamu sendiri\Ntidak ada niat membunuh?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.08,0:00:23.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.42,0:00:26.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Insect lain yang keluar\Ndari gerbang dunia bawah
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.60,0:00:28.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,sangat ingin merebut dunia ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.85,0:00:33.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu memang cita-cita kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.02,0:00:37.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata kamu punya keraguan.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa sebenarnya kamu menentangnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.26,0:00:43.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dunia bawah itu tandus.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.06,0:00:48.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau tidak merebut dunia ini,\Nkami tidak punya masa depan.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.00,0:00:51.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, aku
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.20,0:00:53.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,tidak mengerti.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.77,0:00:55.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, Gran.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.34,0:00:56.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.27,0:01:00.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami tertarik dengan anomali sepertimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.15,0:01:03.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana kalau kamu\Nbergabung dengan kami saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.72,0:01:05.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bergabung dengan kalian?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.46,0:01:08.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Insect sepertiku?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.55,0:01:10.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak terbiasa, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.23,0:01:11.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.69,0:01:15.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,harus memulai perjalanan panjang ke barat.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.55,0:01:20.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu, kami butuh rekan\Nyang dapat dipercaya.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.58,0:01:22.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa namamu?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.86,0:01:24.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak punya.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.09,0:01:28.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, biar aku menamaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.61,0:01:34.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oke.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.70,0:01:37.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mulai sekarang, namamu Razul.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.87,0:01:45.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata banyak juga yang tersedot.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.08,0:01:49.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namaku Maria, dan dia...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.21,0:01:50.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gran.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.30,0:01:52.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Salam kenal, Razul.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.45,0:01:56.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gran, Maria...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.81,0:03:30.66,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku akan menyelamatkan\Njiwa Chloe dan Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.66,0:03:33.71,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Kalau mengintervensi\Njiwa mereka yang tertidur
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.71,0:03:38.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,melalui Transmisi Pikiran, aku mungkin\Nbisa membangunkan mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.98,0:03:40.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, bagaimana caranya?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.90,0:03:43.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga tidak tahu\Npersentase keberhasilannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.92,0:03:48.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada cara untuk membuat rencana Anda\Nberjalan jauh lebih pasti.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.23,0:03:52.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya bermaksud menyampaikannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.34,0:03:53.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.70,0:03:54.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.72,0:03:59.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Caranya, masuk ke dalam tubuh target\Nhanya sebagai tubuh jiwa
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.46,0:04:02.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,saat tubuh material bersentuhan.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.71,0:04:06.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu dengan menghubungkan\Ntubuh jiwa masing-masing,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.96,0:04:11.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anda bisa langsung\Nmengintervensi jiwa target.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.49,0:04:17.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau gegabah, ada kemungkinan\Ntidak bisa kembali, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.95,0:04:22.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kak Raphael, apa tidak bisa mengontaknya\Ndengan Transmisi Pikiran saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.71,0:04:23.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jawab.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.79,0:04:27.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saran individu Diablo\Nmemiliki tingkat keberhasilan tinggi.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.94,0:04:31.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tetapi, bahayanya juga sama tingginya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.83,0:04:33.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.06,0:04:34.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih, Diablo.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.88,0:04:36.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi aku mau bilang sesuatu.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.45,0:04:38.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.45,0:04:41.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu menilaiku terlalu tinggi.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.58,0:04:44.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anda merendah lagi rupanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.64,0:04:47.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya doakan keberhasilannya, Tuan Rimuru.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.46,0:04:49.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa juga yang merendah?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.76,0:04:52.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, bagaimana cara menenangkan Chronoa?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.38,0:04:56.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau kontak fisik pun...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.18,0:04:58.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana kalau pakai Topeng Antimagis?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.64,0:04:59.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Charys?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.62,0:05:01.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gawat, keceplosan.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.70,0:05:05.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia menyadari apa yang kupikirkan juga?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.23,0:05:08.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Topeng itu memiliki kemampuan\Nuntuk menyegel saya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.96,0:05:12.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya rasa topeng itu bisa berfungsi\Nmenstabilkan mentalnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.78,0:05:14.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu rupanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.53,0:05:18.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Topeng dari Shizu yang kuberikan\Npada Chloe mungkin bisa...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.79,0:05:22.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu, topeng itu ada di mana sekarang?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.17,0:05:25.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau terbawa ke masa lalu bersama Chloe,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.81,0:05:29.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,apa topeng itu akan kembali ke Shizu lagi?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.75,0:05:33.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, dari mana topeng itu berasal?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.55,0:05:36.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pikirkan nanti saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.16,0:05:39.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kak Raphael, bisa reproduksi topeng itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.07,0:05:39.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jawab.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.97,0:05:42.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ingin mereproduksi Topeng Antimagis?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.80,0:05:44.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.62,0:05:50.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pinjamkan aku kekuatan, Shizu.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.11,0:05:56.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sisanya, aku yakin mereka bisa\Nmenciptakan celah untukku.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.20,0:06:00.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya, berlindung di belakangku!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.55,0:06:02.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga kuat...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.75,0:06:04.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu juga berlindung!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.84,0:06:12.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Chloe pergi ke mana, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.07,0:06:14.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya, mentang-mentang dia kuat!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.71,0:06:17.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin mencarinya...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.68,0:06:20.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kali ini apa lagi?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.20,0:06:23.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Belum mengakui kekalahan juga?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.68,0:06:25.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berarti cukup sampai di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.95,0:06:29.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan mengalahkan kalian\Nlalu pergi membantu Gran.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.10,0:06:32.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu pikir akan kami biarkan?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.20,0:06:34.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Death Storm!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.88,0:06:39.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Medan gaya khusus, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.38,0:06:42.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sejak tadi sihirku tidak mempan,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.16,0:06:44.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,begitu pula serangan Shion.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.50,0:06:48.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eksoskeleton itu,\Nbukankah lebih keras daripada baja?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.84,0:07:00.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Daya hancur yang luar biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.72,0:07:03.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahkan Intuisi Super milikku pun\Ntidak mampu mengelaknya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.68,0:07:07.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata bentuk sempurna Insect sehebat ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.03,0:07:13.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah dengar tentang Maribel.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.73,0:07:16.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu ingin mencoba peruntungan terakhir, kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.19,0:07:18.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.80,0:07:22.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia putri yang mengingatkanku pada Maria.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.84,0:07:25.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.29,0:07:31.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak ada yang bisa menggantikanku\Nselain anak itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.39,0:07:36.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sendiri tidak tahu\Nbisa bertahan hidup sampai kapan.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.22,0:07:41.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak kusangka di saat seperti ini,\N"harapan" Gran justru sirna.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.56,0:07:46.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setelah melalui berbagai penderitaan,\Nmelawan segalanya,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.32,0:07:50.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan tepat saat keinginan bertahun-tahun ini\Nakhirnya segera terwujud...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.08,0:07:55.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gran, kamu akan mewujudkan keinginanmu, kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.72,0:08:02.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jalanku akan selalu bersamamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.66,0:08:05.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tanpa peduli jalan seperti apa itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.67,0:08:08.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kukatakan,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.69,0:08:11.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,orang yang kupercaya adalah dirimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.48,0:08:15.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serahkan saja padaku, Gran.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.27,0:08:20.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cita-citamu, tidak, cita-cita kita,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.16,0:08:22.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,tidak akan kubiarkan siapa pun\Nmenghalanginya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.26,0:08:28.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ranga, kamu istirahat dulu saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.13,0:08:30.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku punya Pemulihan Super.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.05,0:08:32.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan! Lawan kita kuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.29,0:08:34.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita berdua saja kewalahan begini!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.50,0:08:37.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tenang saja, aku baru dapat cara.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.36,0:08:41.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kumpulkan kekuatanmu sampai kuberi isyarat.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.17,0:08:44.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.72,0:08:46.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tekad yang luar biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.70,0:08:50.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akan kuhancurkan keangkuhanmu itu!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.43,0:08:54.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Skill intrinsik Oni, Ogre Amuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.33,0:08:57.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kekuatan, vitalitas, dan mental
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.84,0:09:01.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,akan meningkat secara keseluruhan,\Ntapi bebannya sangat besar.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.34,0:09:05.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku harus menyelesaikannya\Nsebelum kehilangan akal!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.19,0:09:19.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak boleh tumbang di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.38,0:09:21.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau aku mati di sini,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.12,0:09:23.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,perangnya akan makin parah.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.31,0:09:27.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski tidak bisa menang, minimal ulur waktu
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.03,0:09:29.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan tahan dia di sini!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.35,0:09:34.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bertahan hidup adalah prioritas.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.02,0:09:37.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi bukan berarti\Naku tidak mengincar kemenangan.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.41,0:09:39.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan menang agar dipuji Tuan Rimuru.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.15,0:09:45.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shion?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.64,0:09:50.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terlalu mudah ditebak.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.31,0:10:02.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kemampuan Shion jelas berkembang\Ndalam pertarungan ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.15,0:10:04.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal biasanya hanya modal tenaga...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.86,0:10:07.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Belum selesai!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.95,0:10:12.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Skill Unik milikku, Juru Masak.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.80,0:10:15.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak peduli seberapa kerasnya,\Naku kubelokkan hukum dunia
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.66,0:10:17.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan menghancurkannya dengan Hasil Pasti!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.71,0:10:23.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bidik satu titik, hancurkan eksoskeletonnya!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.47,0:10:25.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal sudah sejauh ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.97,0:10:27.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shion, aku bantu!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.35,0:10:28.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan dulu!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.93,0:10:30.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sia-sia!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.45,0:10:48.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shion!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.83,0:10:51.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akui kekalahanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.83,0:10:54.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah mau berlutut di hadapanku?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.28,0:10:58.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Konyol.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.59,0:10:59.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.86,0:11:02.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berlutut di hadapanmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.27,0:11:06.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Keinginanku adalah mencapai puncak tertinggi.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.43,0:11:07.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.15,0:11:10.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dasar serangga tidak peka.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.64,0:11:12.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bilang
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.43,0:11:14.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku akan melampauimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.45,0:11:24.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seranganmu tidak akan pernah menggapaiku.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.46,0:11:27.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akuilah bahwa dirimu lemah.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.91,0:11:31.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak ada yang bisa dilakukan pecundang.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.96,0:11:37.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.70,0:11:39.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sesuai perkataanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.43,0:11:42.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku lemah.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.13,0:11:48.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagi Ogre sepertiku,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.45,0:11:50.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,kekuatan adalah simbol keadilan.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.75,0:11:55.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka yang lemah akan mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.64,0:11:58.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu hal wajar bagi monster.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.82,0:12:03.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, larangan meremehkan ras lain\Ndari Tuan Rimuru pun
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.26,0:12:06.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,terasa bukan urusanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.04,0:12:11.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, setelah merasakan kematian,\Naku mengetahui rasa takut dibunuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.48,0:12:15.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kemudian, aku diselamatkan oleh Tuan Rimuru.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.27,0:12:18.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ketenangan yang kurasakan waktu itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.54,0:12:22.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengar, Shion, yang terpenting...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.23,0:12:27.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memahami hakikat sejati dari sebuah jiwa.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.09,0:12:31.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Rimuru bilang,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.35,0:12:34.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,nilai suatu jiwa ditentukan\Noleh jalan hidupnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.61,0:12:38.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kuat atau lemah\Ntidak ada artinya sama sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.89,0:12:41.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lihatlah jalan hidupku!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.64,0:12:50.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memang memalukan,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.53,0:12:55.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi ada kalanya aku cemas\Nkarena merasa kalah dari Diablo.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.25,0:13:00.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kekuatanku tidak sampai,\Naku takut Tuan Rimuru akan meninggalkanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.27,0:13:02.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itulah kelemahanku!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.92,0:13:10.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa gunanya iri pada orang lain?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.32,0:13:12.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Fokuslah hanya pada diri sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.72,0:13:14.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lampauilah dirimu sendiri!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.91,0:13:17.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terkonfirmasi.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.49,0:13:20.80,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Kemampuan unik individu Shion, Ogre Amuk,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.80,0:13:24.44,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,berevolusi menjadi Skill Unik, Dewa Amuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.75,0:13:27.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan maju!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.76,0:13:45.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Percuma, kamu tidak akan bisa\Nmenghancurkan eksoskeleton...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.88,0:13:47.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Diam!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.24,0:13:49.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar kutunjukkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.34,0:13:53.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dewi kemenangan hanya akan tersenyum\Nkepada mereka yang pantang menyerah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.61,0:13:54.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan maju!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.50,0:13:56.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pelepasan Amuk!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.91,0:14:04.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tekanan yang luar biasa...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.07,0:14:05.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi belum seberapa!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.04,0:14:06.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ranga!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.93,0:14:08.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siap!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.90,0:14:20.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kurang ajar!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.03,0:14:24.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Chaotic Fate!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.56,0:14:50.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.06,0:14:50.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serahkan padaku!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.56,0:14:57.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu aku, Chloe, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.34,0:15:00.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku pasti akan menyelamatkan jiwa kalian!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.92,0:15:47.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, Gran.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.14,0:15:49.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya hanya sampai di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.65,0:15:52.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku pamit lebih dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.46,0:15:56.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sampai jumpa
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.14,0:15:58.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,di Tanah yang Dijanjikan.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.85,0:16:04.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shion!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.72,0:16:08.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ranga, amankan situasi...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.23,0:16:31.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dunia ini selalu saja langsung\Nmenginjak-injak keinginanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.96,0:16:36.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sahabatku baru saja berpulang.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.18,0:16:37.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Razul, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.80,0:16:43.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu, dunia seperti ini\Nlebih baik dihancurkan saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.74,0:16:45.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan sembarangan!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.59,0:16:48.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau mau berputus asa,\Nlakukan saja sendiri!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.73,0:16:50.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Putus asa?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.62,0:16:53.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu tidak tepat.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.32,0:17:09.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena hatiku baru saja dipenuhi "harapan".
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.38,0:17:25.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Janji dengan orang tercinta dan sahabat,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.94,0:17:27.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,sekaranglah saatnya...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.63,0:17:32.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terkonfirmasi.\NSyarat telah terpenuhi.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.10,0:17:35.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sang Pantang Menyerah\Nmilik individu Granville Rozzo
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.27,0:17:38.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,berevolusi menjadi Skill Ultima, Sariel.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.21,0:17:41.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Harapan, katamu?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.90,0:17:43.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.30,0:17:45.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Persiapanku sudah selesai.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.78,0:17:50.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kamu berhasil, Rimuru?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.90,0:17:53.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku hanya bisa percaya padamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.34,0:18:03.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Luminus, sekaranglah saatnya memutus\Ntakdir ini dan menuntaskan semuanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.56,0:18:05.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.08,0:18:08.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tekadmu, akan kuterima dengan sepenuh hati.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.98,0:18:12.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dan aku pasti akan membunuhmu,\Njadi tenang saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.38,0:18:16.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Asmodeus milikku dan Sariel milik Gran.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.62,0:18:20.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin keduanya sama-sama\Nsoal hidup dan mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.54,0:18:25.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau syaratnya sama, yang menang\Nadalah yang berkehendak lebih kuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.05,0:18:26.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pertarungannya hanya akan sekejap.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.06,0:18:40.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memory End Requiem!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.48,0:18:45.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Fortitude!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.57,0:19:05.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Luar biasa, Nona Luminus.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.10,0:19:28.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini dunia spiritual Chronoa?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.24,0:19:33.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bisa dianggap begitu, kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.32,0:19:35.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku berhasil menyusup, kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.46,0:19:43.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terus aku harus ke mana?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.31,0:19:45.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hai.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.73,0:19:48.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lama tidak berjumpa, Slime.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.92,0:19:51.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh, Satoru, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.09,0:19:52.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shizu?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.36,0:19:58.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, iya, jadi ini proyeksi visual\Nalam bawah sadar.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.36,0:20:03.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang namaku Rimuru.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.33,0:20:07.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukannya ingin membuang masa lalu,\Ntapi aku malu dipanggil begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.12,0:20:11.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah, ayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.01,0:20:11.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.46,0:20:18.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia memang cantik.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.85,0:20:21.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu ingin bertemu dengannya, kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.38,0:20:24.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Chronoa?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.23,0:20:27.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia bisa diajak bicara?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.28,0:20:30.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soalnya di dunia nyata, dia lagi mengamuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.83,0:20:31.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Silakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.70,0:20:35.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya, pertama berdialog dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.60,0:20:40.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Chronoa?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.99,0:20:47.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu Rimuru?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.07,0:20:48.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.82,0:20:51.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rimuru yang asli?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.29,0:20:54.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya, aku Rimuru yang asli.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.39,0:20:56.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rimuru!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.73,0:21:05.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kok beda dari bayanganku?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.85,0:21:08.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku kira dia akan memusuhiku.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.45,0:21:10.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski begitu...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.59,0:21:14.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cewek cantik yang memeluk slime,\Naku terima dengan senang hati.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.98,0:21:20.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu sudah berjuang keras.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.89,0:21:23.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga ingin bertemu denganmu,\NNona Pahlawan.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.86,0:21:25.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.15,0:21:28.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia memang mirip Chloe.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.85,0:21:32.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata wujudnya benaran\NChloe yang sudah dewasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.40,0:21:35.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, aku masih penasaran\Nkenapa dia mengamuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.66,0:21:38.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eng, Chronoa, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.78,0:21:41.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya, aku Chronoa.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.67,0:21:46.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Perwujudan kehancuran\Nyang tersegel di dalam diri Chloe.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.05,0:21:50.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anggap saja seperti kepribadian lain.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:50.17,0:21:55.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau Hinata tidak memberiku nama,\Nkesadaranku tidak akan tumbuh sejauh ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:56.06,0:21:58.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Be-Begitu, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.13,0:22:01.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku kurang paham, tapi situasinya rumit.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:02.16,0:22:06.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku kemari mencari Chloe dan Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:07.09,0:22:08.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa aku bisa bertemu mereka?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:11.39,0:22:13.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak bisa.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:13.32,0:22:14.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:15.33,0:22:19.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Chloe itu tersesat jauh di dalam hatiku,
Dialogue: 10,0:22:19.26,0:22:21.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,di dalam Penjara Tanpa Batas.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:22.61,0:22:25.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:26.17,0:22:30.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hinata... sudah mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:33.47,0:22:34.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:05.92,0:24:09.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selanjutnya, "Kebangkitan Pahlawan".
